{"content":"{\n  \"mechanism\": \"One or several real CV PDFs plus a job requirement -> locate job-relevant evidence with candidate/page identity -> task-sized interview recommendation, optionally a report only when requested.\",\n  \"candidate_reusable_work\": \"Evaluate compact batch PDF preparation, stable candidate/page anchors, targeted evidence lookup and optional literal quote/reference validation. These may replace repeated extraction/copying/identity bookkeeping; final qualification interpretation remains semantic. Choose actual useful code/templates after solving this Maker input, rather than only restating four steps.\",\n  \"do_not_assume\": \"No deterministic keyword score establishes hiring fit. School tier, exact tenure, industry equivalence, missing skill evidence and contradictions require appropriate evidence; no automatic invention/rejection. Do not use name/age/gender/ethnicity/contact fields as fit criteria. No forced long report or all-requirement ledger when the user only asks interview recommendation.\",\n  \"verification_targets\": [\n    \"Actual PDF bytes/page extraction and candidate identity\",\n    \"Different file names and a small multi-PDF batch without cross-candidate mixing\",\n    \"Literal quote/page mismatch and out-of-range page reject when a checker exists\",\n    \"Empty/missing/corrupt PDF explicit error rather than fabricated empty success\",\n    \"No fixed case names, JD contents, candidate answers or hardcoded real PDFs in the skill\"\n  ],\n  \"all_consumption_cases_and_final_answers_withheld_from_Maker\": true,\n  \"local_resource_correctness_is_separate_from_business_quality_or_benefit\": true\n}\n","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"calle6797b25c8f1493caf7ac02999d49c60"}
